          "jcr:created": "Wed Apr 24 2024 17:01:48 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Chair and CEO Kevin Lobo joins the Leadership Reimagined podcast with Janice Ellig, CEO of founder of Ellig Group, to discuss how Stryker’s culture fosters innovation by encouraging employees to play to their strengths and focusing on team-based results that ultimately drive our continued growth. The podcast aims to highlight insights from top leaders and how they champion change within the organization and its boardroom.</p>\n",
